WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.033 --> 00:00:01.568
You have forgiven him.

00:00:01.568 --> 00:00:02.102
But

00:00:03.136 --> 00:00:04.204
from what I read in your book

00:00:04.204 --> 00:00:05.305
and other interviews you've done,

00:00:05.305 --> 00:00:07.340
it doesn't sound like he ever apologized.

00:00:07.507 --> 00:00:11.478
And we know from testimony that

00:00:13.480 --> 00:00:15.382
he gave the impression

00:00:15.382 --> 00:00:17.217
to his top White House aides

00:00:17.217 --> 00:00:18.451
that were there

00:00:18.451 --> 00:00:19.953
when the crowd was chanting

00:00:19.953 --> 00:00:21.388
Hang Mike Pence.

00:00:21.388 --> 00:00:22.922
He said something along the lines

00:00:22.922 --> 00:00:25.658
of according to testimony under oath,

00:00:25.658 --> 00:00:27.861
maybe they're right about you

00:00:29.863 --> 00:00:31.598
So I come from a different

00:00:31.598 --> 00:00:32.499
faith tradition

00:00:32.499 --> 00:00:33.900
that also believes in forgiveness,

00:00:33.900 --> 00:00:36.002
but it also believes in people

00:00:36.002 --> 00:00:37.470
seeking forgiveness

00:00:37.470 --> 00:00:41.107
when they have done wrong to someone

00:00:41.608 --> 00:00:41.975
Well, Jake,

00:00:41.975 --> 00:00:42.909
I don't know what was happening

00:00:42.909 --> 00:00:44.177
at the White House.

00:00:45.178 --> 00:00:47.013
I was at a loading dock at the U.S.

00:00:47.013 --> 00:00:50.083
Capitol Building work in the problem and

00:00:50.083 --> 00:00:52.118
doing my level best to help facilitate

00:00:52.118 --> 00:00:53.019
the arrival of

00:00:54.054 --> 00:00:55.622
security personnel

00:00:55.622 --> 00:00:57.424
to quell the violence

00:00:58.892 --> 00:01:02.362
But what I can tell you is

00:01:02.362 --> 00:01:03.096
in the five days

00:01:03.096 --> 00:01:05.432
following January six, I,

00:01:05.432 --> 00:01:08.101
I made no effort to contact the president

00:01:09.035 --> 00:01:10.336
you said the things publicly

00:01:10.336 --> 00:01:12.338
that I believe needed to be said,

00:01:12.338 --> 00:01:12.705
committed

00:01:12.705 --> 00:01:14.841
to a peaceful transfer of power,

00:01:14.841 --> 00:01:15.842
condemning the violence

00:01:15.842 --> 00:01:17.577
that had taken place

00:01:18.678 --> 00:01:20.880
But when his daughter, Ivanka

00:01:20.880 --> 00:01:22.182
and son in law

00:01:22.182 --> 00:01:23.650
came to my office as I write

00:01:23.650 --> 00:01:24.551
and so help me God

00:01:24.551 --> 00:01:26.352
announced on that following Monday,

00:01:26.352 --> 00:01:27.420
if I'd be willing to sit down

00:01:27.420 --> 00:01:28.021
with the president.

00:01:28.021 --> 00:01:28.655
And I

00:01:29.923 --> 00:01:31.391
told them I wasn't looking for a meeting,

00:01:31.391 --> 00:01:32.425
but if he had something to say

00:01:32.425 --> 00:01:34.094
to me, I'd hear him out.

00:01:34.461 --> 00:01:35.895
Now, I walked down to the Oval Office

00:01:35.895 --> 00:01:37.130
that you've been to many times

00:01:37.130 --> 00:01:37.764
into that back

00:01:37.764 --> 00:01:39.332
hallway in the small dining room

00:01:39.332 --> 00:01:40.433
where the president

00:01:40.433 --> 00:01:42.602
and I had spent so many productive hours

00:01:43.236 --> 00:01:44.804
working through issues at home

00:01:44.804 --> 00:01:45.371
and abroad.

00:01:45.371 --> 00:01:47.607
The progress that we had made

00:01:47.607 --> 00:01:49.275
for a stronger, more prosperous country,

00:01:49.275 --> 00:01:51.244
a lot of it had happened

00:01:51.244 --> 00:01:53.079
over that small dining room table.

00:01:54.747 --> 00:01:57.517
But I walked into the room and the

00:01:57.517 --> 00:01:57.984
president's

00:01:57.984 --> 00:01:59.119
chief of staff was present,

00:01:59.119 --> 00:02:00.920
but he quickly left

00:02:01.921 --> 00:02:02.055
the

00:02:03.123 --> 00:02:06.059
president looked up at me and

00:02:07.427 --> 00:02:08.795
he asked if

00:02:09.062 --> 00:02:11.598
Karen and Charlotte were okay

00:02:13.233 --> 00:02:15.568
And I said tersely,

00:02:15.869 --> 00:02:16.569
They're fine, Mr.

00:02:16.569 --> 00:02:17.303
President.

00:02:18.471 --> 00:02:20.573
And he said, Were you scared?

00:02:21.207 --> 00:02:24.444
And I said, No, I was angry.

00:02:24.811 --> 00:02:26.713
I was angry about the differences we had.

00:02:26.713 --> 00:02:27.680
And I was

00:02:28.681 --> 00:02:29.816
I told him, seeing those people

00:02:29.816 --> 00:02:33.453
ransacking the Capitol, infuriating me

00:02:33.453 --> 00:02:34.621
But we sat for more than an hour

00:02:34.621 --> 00:02:35.622
and a half.

00:02:35.889 --> 00:02:37.490
And I was candid with the president

00:02:37.490 --> 00:02:39.459
about my disappointment.

00:02:39.459 --> 00:02:42.395
And I must tell you that

00:02:45.598 --> 00:02:46.833
I sensed

00:02:46.833 --> 00:02:48.401
the president was deeply remorseful

00:02:48.401 --> 00:02:49.669
in that moment.

00:02:50.770 --> 00:02:52.839
Now, I know that's at odds with people's

00:02:53.106 --> 00:02:54.541
public perception about him.

00:02:54.541 --> 00:02:56.676
But I want to tell you, it was true.

00:02:58.111 --> 00:02:58.711
I could tell he

00:02:58.711 --> 00:03:01.848
was saddened by what had happened.

00:03:01.848 --> 00:03:02.682
And

00:03:04.150 --> 00:03:06.419
we spoke through it that day.

00:03:06.419 --> 00:03:08.755
And I encouraged him to pray.

00:03:09.122 --> 00:03:10.023
He told me many times

00:03:10.023 --> 00:03:10.857
that he was a believer.

00:03:10.857 --> 00:03:12.292
And I told him,

00:03:13.059 --> 00:03:14.561
turn to Jesus.

00:03:15.061 --> 00:03:15.962
Hoping that he would find

00:03:15.962 --> 00:03:16.563
a comfort there

00:03:16.563 --> 00:03:19.332
that I was finding in that moment.

00:03:19.966 --> 00:03:20.900
In the days that followed,

00:03:20.900 --> 00:03:23.203
I made my way back in that office for

00:03:24.070 --> 00:03:26.072
another meeting. And the president.

00:03:26.072 --> 00:03:26.839
Days later,

00:03:26.839 --> 00:03:29.242
was still what I would call downcast

00:03:32.612 --> 00:03:33.613
His voice was fainter

00:03:33.613 --> 00:03:35.248
than I ever remember at any time

00:03:35.248 --> 00:03:36.783
in our four and a half years together.

00:03:36.783 --> 00:03:37.283
And

00:03:39.285 --> 00:03:41.821
after we finished talking through some

00:03:41.821 --> 00:03:43.856
end of the administration business, I

00:03:45.658 --> 00:03:48.695
reminded him that I was praying for him

00:03:49.395 --> 00:03:50.730
And he was dismissive about it.

00:03:52.599 --> 00:03:54.067
But as our meeting came to a close,

00:03:54.067 --> 00:03:55.201
I stood up

00:03:55.635 --> 00:03:58.838
and he was seated at that small table

00:03:58.838 --> 00:04:00.406
and I looked at him and I said,

00:04:00.406 --> 00:04:00.673
I guess

00:04:00.673 --> 00:04:01.407
there's just two things

00:04:01.407 --> 00:04:03.743
we'll probably never agree on.

00:04:05.011 --> 00:04:06.813
And he looked up and

00:04:07.180 --> 00:04:08.281
said, What

00:04:10.183 --> 00:04:10.717
And I referred

00:04:10.717 --> 00:04:13.720
to my role on January six

00:04:14.487 --> 00:04:15.788
And then I said,

00:04:16.656 --> 00:04:19.359
I'm never going to stop praying for you.

00:04:20.159 --> 00:04:23.029
And he smiled faintly and said,

00:04:23.596 --> 00:04:24.664
That's right.

00:04:24.831 --> 00:04:26.399
Don't ever change.

00:04:27.400 --> 00:04:30.169
And we parted amicably.

00:04:30.336 --> 00:04:31.170
As much as we could

00:04:31.170 --> 00:04:33.473
in the aftermath of those events.

00:04:33.473 --> 00:04:34.741
We spoke from time to time

00:04:34.741 --> 00:04:36.109
after we both left office.

00:04:36.109 --> 00:04:36.676
But, Jake,

00:04:36.676 --> 00:04:38.578
after after the president

00:04:38.578 --> 00:04:39.479
returned to the rhetoric

00:04:39.479 --> 00:04:40.747
that he was using

00:04:40.747 --> 00:04:42.782
before that tragic day in January,

00:04:44.083 --> 00:04:46.586
criticizing me and others who had taken

00:04:46.586 --> 00:04:47.754
a stand for the Constitution

00:04:47.754 --> 00:04:48.655
of the United States,

00:04:48.655 --> 00:04:50.456
I just determined

00:04:50.456 --> 00:04:52.892
it was best to go our separate ways.

00:04:52.892 --> 00:04:53.559
And we have.

00:04:54.761 --> 00:04:57.330
But I truly do believe and

00:04:57.330 --> 00:04:59.866
in those moments,

00:05:01.801 --> 00:05:04.337
he was saddened by what had happened,

00:05:04.337 --> 00:05:07.540
and he conveyed that to me and

00:05:07.540 --> 00:05:09.542
in ways that

00:05:10.877 --> 00:05:11.644
that I'll never forget.

